0.12595970506771756,0.15721404296725078,0.18831166648971787,0.21922157684769134,0.24991296237030836,0.28035522921701445,0.3105180318741688,0.34037130340411287,0.3698852854165468,0.399030557732341,0.4277780677102096,0.45609915920701594,0.48396560114283876,0.5113496156423266,0.5382239057242886,0.5645616825119181,0.5903366919365284,0.6155232409081792,0.6400962229271072,0.6640311431104312,0.6873041426091843,0.7098920223913328,0.7317722663670768,0.752923063833377,0.773323331215339,0.7929527330827785,0.8117917024210207,0.8298214601357259,0.8470240337722988,0.8633822754312233,0.8788798788614602,0.8935013957148741,0.9072322509454814,0.9200587573381745,0.9319681291524348,0.942948494867437,0.9529889090158392,0.9620793630944628,0.9702107955409863,0.9773751007667072,0.98356513723637,0.9887747345870026,0.9929986997786696,0.9962328222710067,0.9984738782203788,0.9997196336934779,0.9999688468941563,0.9992212694012756,0.9974776464163387,0.994739716020657,0.9910102074427921,0.9862928383380027,0.9805923110824041,0.9739143080855377,0.9662654861260219,0.9576534697159296,0.9480868435005095,0.9375751437008251,0.9261288486078412,0.9137593681374367,0.9004790324567516,0.8863010796932087,0.8712396427384597,0.8553097351604118,0.8385272362373776,0.8209088751292626,0.802472214201578,0.7832356315188905,0.7632183025251684,0.7424401809292833,0.7209219788147164,0.6986851459933066,0.6757518486236088,0.6521449471151868,0.6278879733408587,0.6030051071796145,0.5775211524135886,0.5514615120031076,0.5248521627644684,0.4977196294756834,0.47009095843600296,0.44199369050557913,0.4134558336521342,0.384505835032011,0.35517255263342823,0.32548522651021206,0.29547344963467004,0.2651671383986787,0.23459650279236888,0.20379201629015192,0.17278438547409986,0.14160451942495159,0.11028349891127508,0.0788525454074766,0.04734298997155776,0.015786242013637264,-0.015786242013636577,-0.04734298997155752,-0.07885254540747635,-0.11028349891127483,-0.14160451942495178,-0.1727843854740992,-0.20379201629015167,-0.23459650279236863,-0.2651671383986785,-0.29547344963467026,-0.3254852265102114,-0.355172552633428,-0.38450583503201075,-0.41345583365213395,-0.4419936905055793,-0.47009095843600274,-0.49771962947568277,-0.5248521627644683,-0.5514615120031073,-0.5775211524135888,-0.6030051071796143,-0.6278879733408581,-0.6521449471151866,-0.6757518486236087,-0.6986851459933067,-0.7209219788147164,-0.7424401809292829,-0.7632183025251682,-0.7832356315188903,-0.8024722142015781,-0.8209088751292625,-0.838527236237377,-0.8553097351604116,-0.8712396427384596,-0.8863010796932088,-0.9004790324567515,-0.9137593681374364,-0.9261288486078411,-0.9375751437008251,-0.9480868435005096,-0.9576534697159295,-0.9662654861260217,-0.9739143080855377,-0.9805923110824041,-0.9862928383380027,-0.9910102074427921,-0.9947397160206569,-0.9974776464163387,-0.9992212694012756,-0.9999688468941563,-0.9997196336934779,-0.9984738782203789,-0.9962328222710067,-0.9929986997786696,-0.9887747345870026,-0.98356513723637,-0.9773751007667073,-0.9702107955409863,-0.9620793630944628,-0.9529889090158394,-0.942948494867437,-0.9319681291524351,-0.9200587573381745,-0.9072322509454813,-0.8935013957148743,-0.8788798788614604,-0.8633822754312237,-0.847024033772299,-0.8298214601357258,-0.8117917024210209,-0.7929527330827786,-0.7733233312153395,-0.7529230638333771,-0.7317722663670767,-0.7098920223913331,-0.6873041426091843,-0.664031143110431,-0.6400962229271073,-0.6155232409081798,-0.5903366919365287,-0.5645616825119181,-0.5382239057242882,-0.5113496156423268,-0.4839656011428394,-0.45609915920701627,-0.4277780677102096,-0.3990305577323406,-0.36988528541654697,-0.3403713034041135,-0.3105180318741691,-0.28035522921701433,-0.24991296237030794,-0.21922157684769145,-0.18831166648971848,-0.15721404296725106,-0.12595970506771748,-0.0945798077948445,-0.06310563131267372,-0.03156854976481113,-2.4492935982947064e-16],\"type\":\"scatter\",\"mode\":\"lines\",\"line\":{\"color\":\"blue\",\"width\":2},\"name\":\"contour |z| = 1\"},{\"x\":[0.0],\"y\":[0.0],\"type\":\"scatter\",\"mode\":\"markers\",\"marker\":{\"color\":\"red\",\"size\":10},\"name\":\"singularity at z = 0\"}],\"layout\":{\"title\":{\"text\":\"∮_{|z|=1} 1/z dz = 2πi — contour encloses singularity\"},\"showlegend\":true,\"width\":700,\"height\":700,\"plot_bgcolor\":\"white\",\"paper_bgcolor\":\"white\",\"xaxis\":{\"title\":{\"text\":\"Re z\"},\"showgrid\":true,\"gridcolor\":\"#ddd\",\"linecolor\":\"#ddd\",\"linewidth\":1,\"zerolinecolor\":\"black\",\"zerolinewidth\":1},\"yaxis\":{\"title\":{\"text\":\"Im z\"},\"showgrid\":true,\"scaleanchor\":\"x\",\"scaleratio\":1,\"gridcolor\":\"#ddd\",\"linecolor\":\"#ddd\",\"linewidth\":1,\"zerolinecolor\":\"black\",\"zerolinewidth\":1}}}"
            ]
          },
          "metadata": {},
          "output_type": "display_data"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "## Estimate: the ML inequality\n\nUseful for bounding contour integrals: if $|f(z)| \\le M$ on $\\gamma$ and $\\gamma$ has length $L$, then\n\n$$\\left|\\int_\\gamma f(z)\\,dz\\right| \\le M \\cdot L.$$\n\nSharp bounds via this estimate are at the heart of arguments like Liouville's theorem (entire bounded ⇒ constant): bound the derivative integral on circles of radius $R$, let $R \\to \\infty$.\n\n## Why $\\oint = 0$ matters\n\nCauchy's theorem is the source of an enormous amount of structure:\n\n1. **Existence of antiderivatives** on simply connected domains (extending FTC).\n2. **Cauchy's integral formula** (next notebook): $f(z_0) = \\dfrac{1}{2\\pi i} \\oint \\dfrac{f(z)}{z - z_0}\\,dz$. Values at interior points are determined by boundary values.\n3. **Residue theorem**: $\\oint f = 2\\pi i \\sum \\mathrm{Res}$ — turns contour integrals into a sum over isolated singularities.\n4. **Evaluation of real integrals**: many otherwise-intractable real definite integrals can be computed via clever closed contours in the complex plane.\n\nWe're heading directly to all of this.\n\n## Numerical sanity check [S+N]\n\nApproximate $\\oint_{|z|=1} 1/z\\,dz$ by a Riemann sum on a fine partition of the unit circle.\n",
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "N_partition : 1000$\ndt : 2 * float(%pi) / N_partition$\ntotal : 0.0 + 0.0 * %i$\nfor k : 0 thru N_partition - 1 do block([t, z, dz_dt],\n  t : k * dt,\n  z : exp(%i * t),\n  dz_dt : %i * exp(%i * t),\n  total : total + 1/z * dz_dt * dt)$\nprint(\"Numerical ∮_{|z|=1} 1/z dz ≈\", expand(total))$\nprint(\"Exact: 2πi =\", float(2*%pi)*%i)$",
      "metadata": {},
      "execution_count": 12,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "stdout",
          "output_type": "stream",
          "text": [
            "Numerical ∮_{|z|=1} 1/z dz ≈ 6.283185307179473*%i\nExact: 2πi = 6.283185307179586*%i"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "Numerical and symbolic agree to many digits — Cauchy's theorem isn't just a slogan, it's something you can verify computationally.\n\nNext: Cauchy's integral formula and the consequence that holomorphic = analytic.\n",
      "metadata": {}
    }
  ]
}